# Siblings the CI gate checks out (at origin/master) next to this repo so the
# decoder's cross-repo conformance tests resolve ../xchain-encoder deterministically.
# Without this, the byte-identity drift-guard (roundtripConformance) reads whatever
# stale checkout happens to sit at the venue's work/xchain-encoder and can fail on a
# non-canonical leftover; shipping the canonical origin/master copy makes the guard
# run against the single source of truth (and self-heals any leftover via rm -rf).
xchain-encoder
